# --- Never commit source datasets or build tooling -------------------------
# The source GPKG is hundreds of MB and is an INPUT, not a deliverable.
*.gpkg
*.gpkg-shm
*.gpkg-wal
tippecanoe/

# Raw intermediate from script 01
data/buildings/*.geojsonl

# Raw model output — inputs, not deliverables. Keep these outside the repo if
# you can; this is the safety net if a run directory ends up inside it.
wrfout_*
wrfinput_*
wrfbdy_*
met_em.*
typescript

# --- Generated demo data IS committed (zero extra hosting) ------------------
